OL,3,AUS immigration officials defend ICE
OL,4,Aagents who shot man in same car as
OL,5,Achild
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS immigration officials have defended
OL,8,Fthe actions of officers who shot and
OL,9,Fwounded a man in his car in New York on
OL,10,FThursday while his five-year-old son
OL,11,Fwas in the back seat.
OL,13,FMarkwayne Mullin, the head of the
OL,14,FDepartment of Homeland Security (DHS),
OL,15,Fwhich runs the Immigration and Customs
OL,16,FEnforcement (ICE), said officers fired
OL,17,Ftheir weapons while trying to arrest a
OL,18,Fman with a criminal history.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
