OL,3,AUS immigration officials defend ICE
OL,4,Aagents who shot man in same car as
OL,5,Achild
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We weren't aware the child was in the
OL,8,Fcar," Mullin added at a news conference
OL,9,Fon Friday, arguing that it was the man,
OL,10,FOscar Belgal, who had put his child in
OL,11,Fdanger. Belgal is now being held at a
OL,12,Fdetention facility.
OL,14,FThe legal organisation representing
OL,15,FBelgal told the BBC that lawyers had
OL,16,Fnot yet been able to speak to him.
